course: dictionary
lesson: 181
title: AI: artificial intelligence
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: AI is a short way of writing artificial intelligence. It means computer programs that can do tasks that seem to need thinking, such as understanding speech, recognising pictures or answering questions. «AI means artificial intelligence: computer programs that do tasks like talking, sorting or answering.»
explain: An AI is one of these programs or systems. Context helps here: «Handing in work you did not do, from a person, a website or an AI chatbot, is cheating.» A chatbot is a program you can type or talk to, so an AI chatbot is an AI you can chat with. Swap in your meaning and check that the sentence still makes sense.
explain: AI is useful, but it can make mistakes. Because it learns from examples, it can get things wrong or be fooled. That is why you should check what an AI tells you with a trusted source, such as a book, a teacher or a reliable website.
fact: AI stands for artificial intelligence.
fact: AI learns patterns from lots of examples, which are called data.
fact: Voice assistants, photo apps, chatbots and game opponents can all use AI.
fact: AI can make fake pictures, voices and videos. These are called deepfakes.
fact: In crossword puzzles, «ai» means a three-toed sloth, an animal from South American rainforests.
exercise: What does AI stand for? | Advanced ideas | * Artificial intelligence | Automatic internet | Artificial intelligence
exercise: Which is a good check for an answer from an AI? | Share it at once with your friends | Believe it, because a computer said it | * Check it with a trusted source | Send it your password to be sure
exercise: In a crossword, «ai» means which animal? | * A three-toed sloth | A penguin | An elephant | A tiger
test: «Handing in work you did not do, from a person, a website or an AI chatbot, is cheating.» In this sentence, what is an AI chatbot? | A person who marks homework | A type of food | A rainforest animal | * A computer program you can chat with
test: What is the safest thing to do when you use an AI chatbot? | * Never share private information with it | Share your home address and passwords so it can help you | Ask it for other people's passwords | Believe every answer it gives you
exam: Which statement about AI is true? | * AI learns patterns from lots of examples, and it can make mistakes | AI is a type of animal | AI never makes mistakes | AI always tells the truth about pictures
